                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game came out a while ago, and honestly I still think it stands today. The levels are reasonably short while also having challenges to make it feel more replayable. The game feels mostly fair, when your fail it's usually your fault. I haven't come across any bugs in particular. I owned this on the 2DS as well as the sequel game which never had a PC release. Though I wish it had, as that one has a level designer which would've been a lot better on PC. \r\n\r\n(Works well on Linux)",
